# MiniZinc: The MiniZinc Handbook (2.8): language reference; requirements/languages/minizinc.md
name     minizinc mzn dzn
keyword  var par int float bool set of array constraint solve satisfy minimize maximize output
keyword  predicate function test include enum ann if then elseif else endif let in where forall
keyword  exists sum product
builtin  true false alldifferent show abs max min
line-comment   %
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
operators  +-*/<>=!:\/.|
calls
